      420.06,
      491.74
    ],
    "reading_order": 17,
    "text": "Similarly this is also an AP whose first term is 6 and the common difference\nis –3.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
    "document_id": "NCERT_X_MATH_JEMH105",
