    "reading_order": 20,
    "text": "To obtain d in a given AP, we need not find all of a2 – a1, a3 – a2, a4 – a3, . . . .\nIt is enough to find only one of them.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
